---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="Home" description="Vega Financial - Big dreams deserve better than one-size-fits-all portfolios">
  <!-- Hero Section -->
  <section class="bg-gradient-to-b text-white py-32">
    <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-4 text-center">
      <div class="badge">THE ONLY INDEPENDENT FIDUCIARY</div>
      <h1 class="text-6xl font-bold mb-8 leading-tight">Big dreams deserve better than <br /><em>"One-size-fits-all" portfolios</em></h1>
      <p class="text-xl mb-12 text-gray-300 max-w-3xl mx-auto leading-relaxed">At Vega Financial, we're a fiercely independent fiduciary firm committed to putting your own interests first. We challenge conventional wisdom, deliver personalized solutions, and thrive on building long-term relationships with clients who value integrity and objectivity.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Who We Serve Section -->
  <section class="py-24 bg-white">
    <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-4">
      <div class="text-center mb-16">
        <h2 class="text-5xl font-bold text-vega-navy mb-4">Who We Serve</h2>
      </div>
      
      <div class="cards-3col">
        <div class="card">
          <div class="card-icon">👥</div>
          <h3>Pre-Retirees And Retirees</h3>
          <p class="text-gray-600">We show your savings how to work for you, and coordinate with your tax and estate plan as if it were one cohesive whole.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="card">
          <div class="card-icon">💼</div>
          <h3>Working Professionals</h3>
          <p class="text-gray-600">From 401(k)s to equity compensation accounts to everything rolled together, we simplify managing wealth during your career.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="card">
          <div class="card-icon">🏢</div>
          <h3>Business Owners</h3>
          <p class="text-gray-600">Let's clarify the financial impacts of your decisions with a coordinated wealth plan, succession planning, and more.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Solutions Section -->
  <section class="py-24 bg-gray-50">
    <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-4">
      <div class="text-center mb-16">
        <h2 class="text-5xl font-bold text-vega-navy mb-4">Solutions For Every Financial Need</h2>
        <p class="text-lg text-gray-600 max-w-2xl mx-auto">We provide goal-efficient portfolio construction, comprehensive wealth management, and ongoing discussions to align your coordinated strategy with your goals.</p>
      </div>
      
      <div class="solutions-grid">
        <div class="solution-item">Comprehensive portfolio management</div>
        <div class="solution-item">Ongoing investment monitoring</div>
        <div class="solution-item">Proactive reviews</div>
        <div class="solution-item">Financial planning</div>
        <div class="solution-item">Investment strategies</div>
        <div class="solution-item">Insurance valuation</div>
        <div class="solution-item">Cash flow and tax planning</div>
        <div class="solution-item">Wealth management</div>
        <div class="solution-item">Income distribution</div>
        <div class="solution-item">Estate planning</div>
        <div class="solution-item">Retirement planning</div>
        <div class="solution-item">Coordinator with other professionals</div>
      </div>

      <div class="text-center mt-16">
        <a href="https://scheduler.zoom.us/tyson-farmer/start-your-financial-journey-with-vega" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="btn btn-secondary">
          Learn More About Our Investing →
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- What Matters Most Section -->
  <section class="py-24 bg-white">
    <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-4">
      <div class="text-center mb-16">
        <h2 class="text-5xl font-bold text-vega-navy mb-4">What Matters Most</h2>
        <p class="text-lg text-gray-600">Our approach is built on principles that set you first</p>
      </div>
      
      <div class="icon-cards-grid">
        <div class="icon-card">
          <div class="icon-circle">🤝</div>
          <h3>Holding the Relationship Accountable</h3>
          <p>Fiduciaries aren't common in the industry; at Vega, our legal duty to you makes us a "leader" in this regard.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="icon-card">
          <div class="icon-circle">🎯</div>
          <h3>Why Being Objective Is Important</h3>
          <p>We believe fiduciary is inherent to sound, objective decision-making. Being objective is fundamental to our decisions.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="icon-card">
          <div class="icon-circle">🔮</div>
          <h3>Proactive Planning</h3>
          <p>By regularly assessing market conditions and anticipating transitions, we help you plan ahead and navigate successfully.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="icon-card">
          <div class="icon-circle">👥</div>
          <h3>Working Together as a Team</h3>
          <p>The relationship we forge together is built on shared concern for your future and our commitment to your success.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="icon-card">
          <div class="icon-circle">📚</div>
          <h3>Providing Necessary Education</h3>
          <p>We believe in educating our clients so you understand your investments and feel confident in your financial strategy.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="icon-card">
          <div class="icon-circle">✨</div>
          <h3>A Financial Life Well Organized</h3>
          <p>We believe a life is led better when your personal and financial life clearly reflects who you are and what matters most.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- CTA Section -->
  <section class="bg-gradient-to-r text-white py-20">
    <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-4 text-center">
      <h2 class="text-4xl font-bold mb-4">Ready to Work Together?</h2>
      <p class="text-xl mb-12 text-blue-100">Let's start building your tax-optimized financial plan today</p>
      <div class="button-group">
        <a href="/engagement/" class="btn btn-outline">Engagement Options</a>
        <a href="https://scheduler.zoom.us/tyson-farmer/start-your-financial-journey-with-vega" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="btn btn-primary">Get Started Today →</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
